			"note": "the lead story (big image, bold headline) sits in an 800px-wide left column; a 380px-wide right rail (\"Latest/Following\" story list, ads) is a fixed measurement, not a share of the room — it stays 380px whether the window is 1280 or 3440. The whole pair is capped at 1300px total and centred from 1920 up, exactly the fluid-then-capped pattern several other sites in this set use."
